    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11569" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαρτ-ισμός</span></b> , ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>completion,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ev.Luc.
				14.28
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔργων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PGiss.</u>
					67.9
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογοθεσίας</span>
			Mitteis <i><span class="en">
				<u>Chr.</u>
				88iv 25
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ᾽ ἀπαρτισμόν</span>”
				<i>precisely,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Chrysipp.Stoic.
					2.164
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ κατ᾽ ἀπαρτισμὸν ἀλλ᾽ ἐν πλάτει</span>”
				<i>not narrowly but broadly,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Comp.</u>
					24
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>rounding off,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαλάνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antyll.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				50.3.1
			</span></i>.</div>
